    "title": "Man arrested by BCSO after meth, knife, drug paraphernalia found - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Will Anderson ,\n7 hours ago OROVILLE, Calif. - A Oroville man was taken into custody by the Butte County Sheriff's Office after a search turned up narcotics and a prohibited knife. The Butte County Sheriff's Office says at around 7:50 a.m. on Saturday, one of their deputies initiated an enforcement stop on a man riding a bicycle in the area of South Fifth Avenue and Cal Oaks Road. Read full article\n4",
